1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,930
Welcome to Daily Grace.

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:05,159
Picture a house
with a plain front door.

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,099
Nothing about it catches

4
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,850
your eye as you walk past.

5
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:09,739
But open the door,

6
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:12,630
and room after room
is full of treasure.

7
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,499
Jesus once said,

8
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:15,779
‘the kingdom
of heaven is like

9
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,990
unto treasure hid in a field’.

10
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:19,259
Some of the best things

11
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:20,599
are not on the surface.

12
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:21,990
They are waiting to be found.

13
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,379
Daily Grace is a little
like that house.

14
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:26,299
You may have come here

15
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,999
to look up a Bible verse,

16
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,079
and you can.

17
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:30,379
But Daily Grace was made

18
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:32,039
for much more
than searching.

19
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:32,999
It was made to help

20
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,519
you understand the Bible,

21
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,459
to remember it, and to live it,

22
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:38,099
one day at a time.

23
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:40,659
It is a complete
Bible in your hand.

24
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:41,959
So let us take a short

25
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:43,190
walk through the rooms.

26
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:44,999
Start with your notes.

27
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:45,979
When something in the Bible

28
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:46,819
speaks to you,

29
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:47,679
you do not need to reach

30
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:49,199
for a pen and paper.

31
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,719
Write it in My Faith Journal,

32
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:52,919
and it is there,
waiting for you,

33
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,330
whenever you come back.

34
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:56,079
If you love to share,

35
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:57,679
Daily Grace is ready.

36
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:58,419
Quotes,

37
00:00:58,420 --> 00:00:59,539
verse pictures and stickers

38
00:00:59,540 --> 00:01:01,099
are at your fingertips,

39
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:02,119
to send to a friend

40
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:04,199
or to post for others to see.

41
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,119
A word of encouragement

42
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:06,970
can travel a long way.

43
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,679
Life brings hard questions.

44
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:11,279
Why do I worry so much?

45
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:12,739
How can I forgive?

46
00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:14,899
What do I do
when I am afraid?

47
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:16,959
In Questions We All Ask,

48
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:18,979
the questions people
ask most often

49
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:20,870
are answered from
the Word of God.

50
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:22,059
Would you like to hear

51
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:24,019
Jesus in his own words?

52
00:01:24,020 --> 00:01:25,879
In Red-Lettered Quotes,

53
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:26,779
the teachings of Jesus

54
00:01:26,780 --> 00:01:28,719
himself are gathered for you,

55
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:29,639
in red,

56
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:31,619
just as many
Bibles print them.

57
00:01:31,620 --> 00:01:32,559
And when you meet a name

58
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:34,019
in the Bible and wonder,

59
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:35,099
who was that,

60
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:37,519
Bible Characters
and Peoples of the Bible

61
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:38,379
help you learn

62
00:01:38,380 --> 00:01:39,939
the men and women
of Scripture,

63
00:01:39,940 --> 00:01:41,430
and the part each one played.

64
00:01:41,780 --> 00:01:43,639
Perhaps reading
is not your thing.

65
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,679
That is alright.

66
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,359
The Bible says,

67
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:47,799
‘So then faith
cometh by hearing,

68
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:49,939
and hearing
by the word of God.’

69
00:01:49,940 --> 00:01:51,779
On The Living Voice,

70
00:01:51,780 --> 00:01:52,479
you can walk through

71
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,839
the Bible by listening,

72
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,319
one chapter at a time,

73
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:58,079
in plain words,
wherever you are.

74
00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:59,339
Have you ever
said that someone

75
00:01:59,340 --> 00:02:01,339
is the salt of the earth?

76
00:02:01,340 --> 00:02:02,359
Or that you escaped

77
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:03,810
by the skin of your teeth?

78
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:06,299
Or that the writing
is on the wall?

79
00:02:06,300 --> 00:02:07,799
Many sayings we hear every

80
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:09,539
day began in the Bible,

81
00:02:09,540 --> 00:02:11,430
and most people
never knew it.

82
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,739
Bible Sayings shows

83
00:02:12,740 --> 00:02:14,339
you where they came from.

84
00:02:14,340 --> 00:02:16,779
And if you enjoy
a good surprise,

85
00:02:16,780 --> 00:02:18,839
Did You Know
and Bible Trivia

86
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:20,050
are full of them.

87
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:21,819
For the road ahead,

88
00:02:21,820 --> 00:02:23,999
there
is Following God’s Blueprint,

89
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,399
a clear path through what

90
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,599
the Lord asks of us,

91
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:28,979
so that you can
walk the right way.

92
00:02:28,980 --> 00:02:30,439
As the psalm says,

93
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:32,459
‘Thy word is a lamp
unto my feet,

94
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:34,150
and a light unto my path.’

95
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:35,479
Every week,

96
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:36,899
the Memory Verse Challenge
gives

97
00:02:36,900 --> 00:02:38,959
you one verse
to hide in your heart.

98
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:39,799
And every day,

99
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,979
there is Food for Thought,

100
00:02:40,980 --> 00:02:43,819
a small portion
of the Word to feed on,

101
00:02:43,820 --> 00:02:45,350
and to think about as you go.

102
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:47,979
Some of us learn
best with our eyes.

103
00:02:47,980 --> 00:02:49,679
The illustrated Bible stories,

104
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,919
drawn like comics,

105
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:53,139
help you see
each story unfold,

106
00:02:53,140 --> 00:02:54,279
so that you can picture it,

107
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:56,390
and appreciate
it all the more.

108
00:02:56,900 --> 00:02:58,839
And as you come
back day after day,

109
00:02:58,840 --> 00:02:59,639
you earn stickers

110
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:01,719
and badges along the way.

111
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:03,419
Keep them
in your Sticker Album,

112
00:03:03,420 --> 00:03:04,659
share them with your friends,

113
00:03:04,660 --> 00:03:05,959
or print them out and put

114
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,159
them anywhere you like,

115
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,679
on a notebook, a fridge,

116
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,910
or a bedroom door.

117
00:03:10,380 --> 00:03:12,759
Daily Grace is not
only for grown ups.

118
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:15,139
Daily Grace Kids
is a place for children

119
00:03:15,140 --> 00:03:16,619
from three
to twelve years old,

120
00:03:16,620 --> 00:03:17,579
where they can play,

121
00:03:17,580 --> 00:03:19,930
and learn the Bible
early in life.

122
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,059
Paul wrote to young Timothy,

123
00:03:22,060 --> 00:03:23,219
‘from a child thou hast

124
00:03:23,220 --> 00:03:24,650
known the holy scriptures’.

125
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:26,930
What a gift to give a child.

126
00:03:27,460 --> 00:03:28,639
So do not judge

127
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:30,259
Daily Grace by its cover.

128
00:03:30,260 --> 00:03:31,799
The screen may look simple,

129
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:32,819
but deep inside,

130
00:03:32,820 --> 00:03:34,639
it is full of wonder,

131
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:35,910
waiting to be discovered.

132
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,899
The psalmist prayed,

133
00:03:37,900 --> 00:03:39,179
‘Open thou mine eyes,

134
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:40,599
that I may behold wondrous

135
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:42,299
things out of thy law.’

136
00:03:42,300 --> 00:03:43,759
That is our prayer for you,

137
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:45,550
as you embrace
the Word of the Lord.

138
00:03:46,020 --> 00:03:48,359
Here is a question
to carry with you.

139
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,639
Which room in Daily Grace

140
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:51,179
will you open first,

141
00:03:51,180 --> 00:03:52,179
and what do you hope God

142
00:03:52,180 --> 00:03:53,170
will show you there?

143
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:54,580
Let us pray.

144
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:57,099
Lord God, thank
you for your Word,

145
00:03:57,100 --> 00:03:58,759
which is a lamp to my feet

146
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:00,030
and a light to my path.

147
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,379
Open my eyes to see

148
00:04:01,380 --> 00:04:03,279
the wonderful things in it.

149
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,799
Help me not only to read it,

150
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,459
but to understand it,

151
00:04:06,460 --> 00:04:08,739
to remember it, and to live it,

152
00:04:08,740 --> 00:04:09,710
every day.

153
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:11,100
Amen.

154
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:13,919
So choose a room,
and step inside.

155
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:15,950
There is grace
waiting for you there.

156
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:18,379
This has been Daily Grace.

157
00:04:18,380 --> 00:04:19,439
Grace for Today.

158
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:20,510
Our Faith Tomorrow.
